Hello,

As announced in the report [1] of the previous Developer Day that took
place in October in Cambridge (UK), the next Buildroot Developer Day
will take place on Monday, 7th February in Brussels, just after the
FOSDEM conference.

Peter Korsgaard, Yann E. Morin and myself have already confirmed their
participation.

If they are other Buildroot developers/contributors interested in
joining this Developer Day, they are invited to reply to this e-mail.

The Buildroot Developer Day is the occasion to discuss the design of
the upcoming features in Buildroot, and sometimes do a little bit of
hacking on the code.

Regards,

Thomas

